  "summary_en": "UNESCO's 2021 Recommendation on the Ethics of AI, adopted by the General Conference in French on its web page. It sets values, principles and policy action areas centred on human rights and dignity, calling on member states to adopt oversight, impact assessment, certification, accountability and redress mechanisms for AI systems.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Human rights, dignity, environment and inclusion as core values",
